  m_Name: Cylinder.004_Material.008_0
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Gasket (2)
  description: The Gasket (2) is a small, thin-flat seal located at the bottom-center-rear
    of the engine, responsible for preventing fluid leaks and maintaining pressure.
    Composed of Material.008, this gasket provides a reliable seal between components,
    even under high temperatures and pressures. Interestingly, the gasket's small
    size and flexibility enable it to conform to intricate surfaces, ensuring a tight
    seal and preventing potential engine damage.
